    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3417370/extras/15260467c8ee1f603be6041844e9c458.poster.avif?t=1737802487\" width=600 height=172 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3417370/extras/15260467c8ee1f603be6041844e9c458.webm?t=1737802487\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3417370/extras/15260467c8ee1f603be6041844e9c458.mp4?t=1737802487\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><strong>Play with your Past in 27 different levels</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Trapped in a <strong>time loop</strong>, your past actions become your greatest ally. <strong>Strategize</strong> as each loop <strong>replays</strong> your previous movements, unlocking the path to success in a clever <strong>dance with time</strong>. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3417370/extras/6febb41afe434b9a7aa10062b8e84db8.poster.avif?t=1737802487\" width=608 height=174 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3417370/extras/6febb41afe434b9a7aa10062b8e84db8.webm?t=1737802487\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3417370/extras/6febb41afe434b9a7aa10062b8e84db8.mp4?t=1737802487\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><strong>Solve Timeless Puzzles</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Face multiple mind-bending <strong>challenges</strong>, each featuring unique <strong>mechanics</strong> to master. Progress through a <strong>semi-linear</strong> journey, solving <strong>puzzles</strong> in the order you choose, and push your problem-solving skills to their limits.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3417370/extras/c8cf3af804af536dcce7ed442e09193d.poster.avif?t=1737802487\" width=608 height=174 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3417370/extras/c8cf3af804af536dcce7ed442e09193d.webm?t=1737802487\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3417370/extras/c8cf3af804af536dcce7ed442e09193d.mp4?t=1737802487\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><strong>Uncover Unique Mechanics</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore diverse <strong>regions</strong> brimming with inventive <strong>puzzle elements</strong>. Adapt to new gameplay twists, transform your character, and harness its <strong>powers</strong> to overcome ever-evolving <strong>challenges</strong> and complete your <strong>journey</strong>.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3417370/extras/15260467c8ee1f603be6041844e9c458.poster.avif?t=1737802487\" width=600 height=172 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3417370/extras/15260467c8ee1f603be6041844e9c458.webm?t=1737802487\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3417370/extras/15260467c8ee1f603be6041844e9c458.mp4?t=1737802487\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><strong>Play with your Past in 27 different levels</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Trapped in a <strong>time loop</strong>, your past actions become your greatest ally. <strong>Strategize</strong> as each loop <strong>replays</strong> your previous movements, unlocking the path to success in a clever <strong>dance with time</strong>. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3417370/extras/6febb41afe434b9a7aa10062b8e84db8.poster.avif?t=1737802487\" width=608 height=174 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3417370/extras/6febb41afe434b9a7aa10062b8e84db8.webm?t=1737802487\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3417370/extras/6febb41afe434b9a7aa10062b8e84db8.mp4?t=1737802487\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><strong>Solve Timeless Puzzles</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Face multiple mind-bending <strong>challenges</strong>, each featuring unique <strong>mechanics</strong> to master. Progress through a <strong>semi-linear</strong> journey, solving <strong>puzzles</strong> in the order you choose, and push your problem-solving skills to their limits.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3417370/extras/c8cf3af804af536dcce7ed442e09193d.poster.avif?t=1737802487\" width=608 height=174 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3417370/extras/c8cf3af804af536dcce7ed442e09193d.webm?t=1737802487\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3417370/extras/c8cf3af804af536dcce7ed442e09193d.mp4?t=1737802487\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><strong>Uncover Unique Mechanics</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore diverse <strong>regions</strong> brimming with inventive <strong>puzzle elements</strong>. Adapt to new gameplay twists, transform your character, and harness its <strong>powers</strong> to overcome ever-evolving <strong>challenges</strong> and complete your <strong>journey</strong>.</p>",
    "short_description": "Complete intricate puzzles by collaborating with echoes of your past actions. Tackle diverse challenges across numerous levels. Play together, but alone!",
